    "text": "This is a greedy heuristic, not an exact solver. Cars are advanced in order of elapsed time. Each step runs Dijkstra from the car's position and picks the unvisited street whose length divided by total travel time to reach and traverse it is largest. The car then walks the shortest path there and traverses the street. A deterministic work budget (arc relaxations, not wall-clock time) caps the running time, so output is reproducible. I have not compiled or run it against the real data sets.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstruct Arc {\n    int to, cost, len, eid;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int N, M, T, C, S;\n    cin >> N >> M >> T >> C >> S;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\n        double la, lo;\n        cin >> la >> lo;\n    }\n\n    vector<vector<Arc>> adj(N);\n    for (int j = 0; j < M; j++) {\n        int A, B, D, Cc, L;\n        cin >> A >> B >> D >> Cc >> L;\n        adj[A].push_back({B, Cc, L, j});\n        if (D == 2) adj[B].push_back({A, Cc, L, j});\n    }\n\n    vector<char> visited(M, 0);\n    vector<int> cur(C, S), elapsed(C, 0);\n    vector<char> active(C, 1);\n    vector<vector<int>> itin(C, vector<int>(1, S));\n\n    const int INF = INT_MAX / 2;\n    vector<int> dist(N), par(N), pe(N);\n    long long work = 0;\n    const long long BUDGET = 400000000LL;\n\n    while (true) {\n        if (work > BUDGET) break;\n\n        // pick active car with minimal elapsed time\n        int c = -1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < C; i++) {\n            if (!active[i]) continue;\n            if (c == -1 || elapsed[i] < elapsed[c]) c = i;\n        }\n        if (c == -1) break;\n\n        int rem = T - elapsed[c];\n        if (rem <= 0) {\n            active[c] = 0;\n            continue;\n        }\n        int src = cur[c];\n\n        fill(dist.begin(), dist.end(), INF);\n        fill(par.begin(), par.end(), -1);\n        fill(pe.begin(), pe.end(), -1);\n        dist[src] = 0;\n\n        priority_queue<pair<int, int>, vector<pair<int, int>>, greater<pair<int, int>>> pq;\n        pq.push({0, src});\n\n        double bestScore = -1.0;\n        int bestU = -1, bestK = -1, bestCost = 0;\n\n        while (!pq.empty()) {\n            auto [d, u] = pq.top();\n            pq.pop();\n            if (d != dist[u]) continue;\n            if (d > rem) break;\n\n            // evaluate candidate unvisited streets leaving u\n            for (int k = 0; k < (int)adj[u].size(); k++) {\n                const Arc &a = adj[u][k];\n                if (visited[a.eid]) continue;\n                if (a.to == par[u]) continue;\n                int tot = d + a.cost;\n                if (tot > rem) continue;\n                double sc = (double)a.len / (double)tot;\n                if (sc > bestScore) {\n                    bestScore = sc;\n                    bestU = u;\n                    bestK = k;\n                    bestCost = a.cost;\n                }\n            }\n\n            // relax\n            work += adj[u].size();\n            for (const Arc &a : adj[u]) {\n                int nd = d + a.cost;\n                if (nd <= rem && nd < dist[a.to]) {\n                    dist[a.to] = nd;\n                    par[a.to] = u;\n                    pe[a.to] = a.eid;\n                    pq.push({nd, a.to});\n                }\n            }\n            if (work > BUDGET) break;\n        }\n\n        if (bestU == -1) {\n            active[c] = 0;\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        // reconstruct path to bestU\n        vector<int> nodes, eds;\n        int v = bestU;\n        while (v != src) {\n            nodes.push_back(v);\n            eds.push_back(pe[v]);\n            v = par[v];\n        }\n        reverse(nodes.begin(), nodes.end());\n        reverse(eds.begin(), eds.end());\n        for (size_t i = 0; i < nodes.size(); i++) {\n            itin[c].push_back(nodes[i]);\n            visited[eds[i]] = 1;\n        }\n\n        const Arc &ta = adj[bestU][bestK];\n        itin[c].push_back(ta.to);\n        visited[ta.eid] = 1;\n        elapsed[c] += dist[bestU] + bestCost;\n        cur[c] = ta.to;\n    }\n\n    string out;\n    out.reserve(1 << 20);\n    out += to_string(C);\n    out += '\\n';\n    for (int i = 0; i < C; i++) {\n        out += to_string(itin[i].size());\n        out += '\\n';\n        for (int x : itin[i]) {\n            out += to_string(x);\n            out += '\\n';\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(), 1, out.size(), stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
